      </div>
     </div>
     <div class=3D"rwui_tab_content" data-name=3D"Account Servicing" data-h=
ash=3D"tab-Account+Servicing">
      <ul>
       <li class=3D"auto-cursor-target">There is no requirement to configur=
e the request types applicable to the features. Access will be granted to a=
ll available request types by default.&nbsp;</li>
       <li class=3D"auto-cursor-target">The features are offered in the int=
egrated SOMA application or iMost (via SOMA).</li>
      </ul>
      <div class=3D"table-wrap">
       <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
        <colgroup>
         <col>
         <col>
         <col>
         <col>
        </colgroup>
        <tbody>
         <tr>
          <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Product Capability</th>
